        "quote": "latent 1.0.7 \n\n- Change the theme from yellow to some other color option\n- Some way to find friends to study with, some kind of \"im looking for friends\" public feed, many people dont have friends that study, like myself : (\n- on pomodoro timer there is a really wierd padding on round and dime selection, text touches the borders, maybe some other way to design it\n- making \"folders\" or something similar so i can say study->math and later can filter on all the time i studied and all the math i studied separately\n- add tags, so you can share your insagram, pinterest or tiktok on your profile (like on tiktok where you have instagram icon)",
