      "inApp": {
        "new": 8,
        "note": "8 new public.feedback rows since yesterday's review (131 total): 1 bug (Joud lost the end of a 3 hour session when the phone died; fixed by #552 in 1.0.9) and 7 ideas: Diya (log a friend's session for both), nico (message times), isaac (sign in with a different Apple ID), aleks (edit the plan, TRY-492), Owen (20 second timelapses), Christopher (group sessions), ethan (search friends by subject tag)."
      },
      "discord": {
        "new": 33,
        "note": "About 50 new since Oct 21 ~9:15 AM PT (about 48 in #general-chat, 2 in Malcolm's public-groups thread, 2 in #questions; nothing new in #feature-requests or #announcements). 1 bug: Ace says a 1 hour 11 minute session was logged as 1 minute 29 seconds (today's fix). Questions: TamilVoid asks if Android is out yet, notjerwee asks how you blurred in the app (Blur #574 isn't in a released build), Yeolify asked for the invite link (Zoe answered), MIX wants an invite code. Idea: chloe suggests ranked groups that kick people who miss their hours. The custom timelapse length vote is now 6 up / 2 down (was 3 / 0; TRY-493). The rest is chatter about college. Source: discord-2026-10-22.md."
      },
      "gmail": {
        "new": 2,
        "note": "None of yesterday's 26 drafts were sent, so all are carried. 2 new replies: Debora (add more tags after signup) and Abel (applied, optional). No new cold hiring emails, no video attachments, no PostHog alert emails. About 10 paid-sponsorship pitches skipped."
      },
